# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker ignore – keeps build context small & fast
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Dependencies (installed inside container)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build outputs
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.next-dev
**/out

# Environment files (passed via docker-compose)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test & coverage
**/coverage
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/test

# Tooling / caches
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/.eslintcache
**/.parcel-cache

# Documentation
*.md
!README.md
LICENSE

# Docker files (prevent recursive copy)
**/Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
.cursor

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Husky
.husky
